  "instructions": [
    "in a small bowl, mix together clotted cream, walnuts, honey, cinnamon, nutmeg, lemon juice, and vanilla extract until well combined",
    "in a separate bowl, mix together melted butter and dried cranberries",
    "place an ssam-wrap on a flat surface and spread a layer of the clotted cream mixture on the bottom half of the wrap",
    "add a few drops of lemon juice to the clotted cream mixture for extra moisture",
    "place a few dried cranberries in the center of the clotted cream mixture",
    "fold the bottom half of the wrap up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll the wrap up to form a tight cylinder",
    "repeat with the remaining ingredients",
    "serve immediately and enjoy",
    "store any leftover wraps in an airtight container in the refrigerator for up to 24 hours",
    "reheat in the microwave or oven before serving"
